@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix oh: <http://semweb.mmlab.be/ns/oh#>.
@prefix w3: <http://www.w3.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix org: <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#>.
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/>.
@prefix airs: <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/airs-linked-data/lov/latest/src/airs_vocabulary.ttl#>.
@prefix dc11: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/>.
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>.
@prefix xmls: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix wgspos: <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#>.
@prefix vcard2006: <http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#>.

("active"
 "defunct"
 "inactive") a rdf:List.
_:B4bb57846815098f58943733d906ad9d9 a rdf:List.
_:B5958f172b0cfaf4e1eeae851cdbac96e a rdf:List.
("active"
 "defunct"
 "inactive") a rdf:List.
